      "id": "claim_37ff3a122e9745fd805c4212aff94f0f",
      "statement": "A bundled format blueprint is two same-stem files — a .gadget archive holding code/bindings and a JSON sidecar holding curated presentation — and the installer writes sidecar values over whatever the archive claims, making archive-carried titles/authors inert.",
