      "statement": "The generator globs the blueprint directory (overridable via FORMAT_BLUEPRINTS_DIR, whose named directory replaces the set entirely) into a generated base64 module and validates sidecars at build time — rejecting unknown keys, bad ids, unknown icons, and reserved control keys — so curation mistakes fail the build rather than mis-present in production.",
